    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SPACIOUS FOUR-BEDROOM DETACHED FAMILY HOME IN A CONVENIENT AND PICTURESQUE LOCATION\n\nSmith Property proudly presents this impressive four-bedroom detached residence to the market, ideally positioned just off the Ballyjamesduff Granard Road. Set on a generous c.0.27 hectare site, the property offers approximately 2,234 sq. ft. of spacious and well-proportioned accommodation, together with a private mature garden and attached garage/workshop.\n\nThe property offers excellent family accommodation throughout, with four generous bedrooms, including one ensuite, two spacious reception rooms and a bright modern kitchen with granite worktops. A large utility/laundry room and guest WC further complement the accommodation.\n\nOutside, the mature private gardens provide a pleasant setting around the property, offering excellent space for family enjoyment, entertaining and gardening. The attached garage/workshop is an additional benefit, providing useful storage and workspace.\n\nThe location is a particular attraction. Situated just off the Ballyjamesduff Granard Road, the property is within easy reach of local amenities, schools and sporting facilities. The beautiful surroundings of Lough Sheelin and Crover House Hotel are only a short distance away, while Oldcastle, Loughcrew and Mullaghmeen Forest are also within easy reach, making this an ideal base for those who enjoy the countryside and outdoor pursuits.\n\n\nOverall, this is a substantial and well-located family home offering generous accommodation, a private mature garden and excellent convenience to the surrounding towns and amenities.\n\nViewing is highly recommended through the sole selling agents, Smith Property.\n\nFeatures - \n\n- Impressive four-bedroom detached residence\n\n- Approx. 2,234 sq. ft.\n\n- Generous c.0.27 hectare site\n\n- Four generous bedrooms, one ensuite\n\n- Two spacious reception rooms\n\n- Bright modern kitchen with granite worktops\n\n- Large utility/laundry room\n\n- Guest WC\nAttached garage/workshop\n\n- Private mature gardens\n\n- Convenient Ballyjamesduff Granard Road location\n\n- Close to Lough Sheelin and Crover House Hotel\n\n- Within easy reach of Oldcastle, Loughcrew and Mullaghmeen Forest\n\n\n"
      },
